<title>FRANCE: TF1 H1 net attributable up 5.9 pct.</title>
<headline>TF1 H1 net attributable up 5.9 pct.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-10-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1996.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of French francs unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net attributable			     425  vs	     401</p>
<p>    Pre-tax, pre-exceptional		   687  vs	     649</p>
<p>    Turnover				     5,002  vs	   4,604</p>
<p>    -- advertising			     3,959  vs	   3,807</p>
<p>    -- diversification and others	  1,043  vs	     797</p>
<p>NOTE - TF1 said that it could not give a forecast for the full year. It said it was very dependent on the economic climate which remained difficult.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
